[{"id":4629316824,"node_id":"PRR_kwDONpzSS88AAAABE-3E2A","user":{"login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer[bot]","id":175728472,"node_id":"BOT_kgDOCnlnWA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copilot-pull-request-reviewer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copilot-pull-request-reviewer%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR restructures the OpenTelemetry instrumentation modules and removes the hard dependency between `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace` instrumentation and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace` internals by routing GLS span lookup through `pkg/runtime`.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add a runtime-level registration/getter for “span-from-GLS” so the trace API hook no longer `go:linkname`s into SDK trace internals.\n- Split/relayout OTel instrumentation into separate modules (`otel/init`, `otel/sdk/trace`, `otel/trace`) and remove obsolete hook/provider/stub files.\n- Update the `otelsdk` test app’s module/imports to reflect the new dependency boundaries.\n\n### Reviewed changes\n\nCopilot reviewed 22 out of 24 changed files in this pull request and generated 2 comments.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Show a summary per file</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| test/apps/otelsdk/main.go | Removes unused blank imports to adjust the app’s build graph. |\r\n| test/apps/otelsdk/go.mod | Moves `go.opentelemetry.io/otel` to indirect while keeping SDK/trace deps explicit. |\r\n| pkg/runtime/trace_context.go | Adds registration/getters for GLS span lookup used by trace API instrumentation. |\r\n| pkg/runtime/go.mod | Promotes `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace` to a direct dependency of `pkg/runtime`. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace/otelc.yaml | New hook rule to inject a post-hook into `trace.SpanFromContext`. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace/hook.go | Implements the `SpanFromContext` after-hook using `pkg/runtime` instead of SDK internals. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace/go.sum | Adds sums for the new `otel/trace` instrumentation module. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace/go.mod | Adds a new module for `otel/trace` instrumentation. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace/stub.go | Removes the stub placeholder now that the SDK trace module has real buildable files. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace/otelc.yaml | Defines SDK trace hooks and injects the trace-context helper file. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace/otel_trace_context.go | Registers SDK-provided GLS span lookup into `pkg/runtime` during init. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace/hook.go | New hook implementations to add/remove spans to/from GLS at SDK trace lifecycle points. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace/go.sum | Updates sums for SDK trace instrumentation module dependencies. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace/go.mod | Fixes module identity and adjusts replace path depth for the moved module. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/trace/gls.go | Refactors GLS add/delete helpers and moves them into the SDK trace module/package. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric/stub.go | Removes obsolete metric stub placeholder. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric/otel_metric_test_func_holder.go | Removes an unused ignored test func holder file. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/README.md | Adds documentation describing the new OTel instrumentation module split and GLS behavior. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/provider/trace/trace_init.go | Removes old provider-related injected file (layout reorg). |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/provider/trace/stub.go | Removes old provider trace stub placeholder. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/hook/span_setup.go | Removes old combined hook implementation (replaced by new per-module hooks). |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/hook/provider_setup.go | Removes old SetTracerProvider hook implementation from the prior layout. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/hook/otelc.yaml | Removes the old monolithic OTel hook configuration file. |\r\n| instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/hook/gls-operation.md | Removes old GLS operation doc (superseded by new README). |\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n<details>\n<summary>Comments suppressed due to low confidence (1)</summary>\n\n**instrumentation/go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace/hook.go:10**\n* This file no longer uses `//go:linkname`, so the `_ \"unsafe\"` side-effect import is unnecessary. Also, the imports are not in gofmt order (github.com imports should sort before go.opentelemetry.io). This may cause formatting/lint failures.\n</details>\n\n\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/new/main?filename=.github/instructions/*.instructions.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add Copilot custom instructions</a> for smarter, more guided reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/customizing-copilot/adding-repository-custom-instructions-for-github-copilot\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to get started</a>.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/647#pullrequestreview-4629316824","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/647","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pull/647#pullrequestreview-4629316824"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go-compile-instrumentation/pulls/647"}},"submitted_at":"2026-07-04T10:14:20Z","commit_id":"c451e98dbe2f132f24ba91fce097be1e6f49a298"},{"id":4629325699,"node_id":"PRR_kwDONpzSS88AAAABE-3ngw","user":{"login":"amazingakai","id":93782497,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZcB4Q","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93782497?u=636eb3c0c0e15f40e91bd088e19b41718b12ddeb&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai","html_url":"https://github.com/amazingakai","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/amazingakai/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://ap